{"id":"0b146f0add46bd47","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-language-indexed-semantics.md","title":"Structures and Satisfaction for First-Order Languages","display":"df-language-indexed-semantics — Structures and Satisfaction for First-Order Languages","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","aliases":["92-df-language-indexed-semantics"],"display":"df-language-indexed-semantics — Structures and Satisfaction for First-Order Languages","source":"一般 Tarski 语义的本地桥接；Smullyan 第 II 章 pp. 18–19 只给指定算术解释","source_status":"原书之外的模型论基础","depends_on":["[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-language-indexed-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language-indexed-semantics — Structures and Satisfaction for First-Order Languages"},{"key":"source","html":"一般 Tarski 语义的本地桥接；Smullyan 第 II 章 pp. 18–19 只给指定算术解释"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的模型论基础"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\">\\(L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>；语法见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(D\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathfrak M}:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\">\\(f^{\\mathfrak M}:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\">\\(r^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\\)</span> 是符号解释；赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:V\\to D\">\\(s:V\\to D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M},\\models_L,\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M},\\models_L,\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L_0\\)</span> 为定义目标。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_G\">\\(\\mathcal L_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_G\">\\(\\iota_G\\)</span> 是下文指定语言及语法翻译。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\coloneqq\\{(D,(f^{\\mathfrak M})_{f\\in F},(r^{\\mathfrak M})_{r\\in R}):\nD\\ne\\varnothing,\\ f^{\\mathfrak M}:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D,\\ r^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\coloneqq\\{(D,(f^{\\mathfrak M})_{f\\in F},(r^{\\mathfrak M})_{r\\in R}):\nD\\ne\\varnothing,\\ f^{\\mathfrak M}:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D,\\ r^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>赋值更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[d/x]\">\\(s[d/x]\\)</span> 只将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的值改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(\\mathrm{var}(x))&amp;=s(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}))&amp;=\nf^{\\mathfrak M}(\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_{k-1})),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(t=u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t)=\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(u),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_Lr(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_j))_{j&lt;a_R(r)}\\in r^{\\mathfrak M},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\land(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\lor(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[d/x]\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[d/x]\\models_L\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(\\mathrm{var}(x))&amp;=s(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}))&amp;=\nf^{\\mathfrak M}(\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_{k-1})),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(t=u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t)=\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(u),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_Lr(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_j))_{j&lt;a_R(r)}\\in r^{\\mathfrak M},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\land(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\lor(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[d/x]\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[d/x]\\models_L\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s:V\\to D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_LT&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi)\\qquad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L),\\\\\nT\\models_L\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_LT\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s:V\\to D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_LT&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi)\\qquad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L),\\\\\nT\\models_L\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_LT\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限元组满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi[\\vec d/\\vec x]\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi[\\vec d/\\vec x]\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_j:j&lt;k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_j:j&lt;k\\}\\)</span>，并表示每个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(x_j)=d_j\">\\(s(x_j)=d_j\\)</span> 的赋值都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 两两不同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L_0\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L_0\\)</span> 保留底集并限制符号解释。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_G&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0,S,+,\\cdot\\},\\varnothing,\\{0\\mapsto0,S\\mapsto1,+\\mapsto2,\\cdot\\mapsto2\\},\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\in&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_G&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0,S,+,\\cdot\\},\\varnothing,\\{0\\mapsto0,S\\mapsto1,+\\mapsto2,\\cdot\\mapsto2\\},\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\in&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_G\">\\(\\iota_G\\)</span> 唯一地将本地合法 token 字串的解析树逐构造器变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_G\">\\(\\mathcal L_G\\)</span> 树；变量、数项和全部联结词/量词保持其对应构造。算术结构的解释数据也逐项保持。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,s\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L_G}\\iota_G(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M,s\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L_G}\\iota_G(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项与公式递归按有限树高度唯一确定；对结构归纳得自由变量赋值独立性和最后一个翻译双条件。零元函数的参数元组唯一，故解释就是常量值。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_\\in\">\\(\\models_\\in\\)</span> 简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\in)\">\\((X,\\in)\\)</span> 的关系解释是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\\cap(X\\times X)\">\\(\\in\\cap(X\\times X)\\)</span>，普通结构要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(X\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。可构造层级的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\varnothing\">\\(X=\\varnothing\\)</span> 情形须另行定义。\n此前 58 与 93 号书分别采用另一签名编码和另一变量/构造器体系；这里补的是与本地 G 字串之间的显式桥接，不宣称这些编号对象字面相同。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\)</span> 是元层的类记号（也可读作集合结构三元组满足所示条件的谓词），不是 ZFC 中包含全部结构的集合。对该类的量化展开为对结构编码集合的量化；不使用不存在的“所有底集的集合”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)$，$L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)$，$V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$；语法见[[92-df-first-order-language]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\mathfrak M}:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"r^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"s:V\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M},\\models_L,\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\coloneqq\\{(D,(f^{\\mathfrak M})_{f\\in F},(r^{\\mathfrak M})_{r\\in R}):\nD\\ne\\varnothing,\\ f^{\\mathfrak M}:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D,\\ r^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s[d/x]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(\\mathrm{var}(x))&=s(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}))&=\nf^{\\mathfrak M}(\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_{k-1})),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(t=u)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t)=\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(u),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_Lr(\\vec t)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\operatorname{Eval}_{L,s}^{\\mathfrak M}(t_j))_{j<a_R(r)}\\in r^{\\mathfrak M},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\neg\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\land(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\lor(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\forall x\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[d/x]\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\exists x\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s[d/x]\\models_L\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s:V\\to D\\;(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_LT&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi)\\qquad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L),\\\\\nT\\models_L\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_LT\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models_L\\varphi[\\vec d/\\vec x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_j:j<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s(x_j)=d_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_G&\\coloneqq(\\{0,S,+,\\cdot\\},\\varnothing,\\{0\\mapsto0,S\\mapsto1,+\\mapsto2,\\cdot\\mapsto2\\},\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\in&\\coloneqq(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,s\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L_G}\\iota_G(\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\models_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathcal L_\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\in\\cap(X\\times X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_L","display":false}],"bytes":4861,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本次修复重点为：同语言系统族的 Con/Complete/Th 签名，开放 PA 公理的全称闭包，IΔ0 演算中的逻辑公理，一般语言的语法/语义/有限演算，以及集合论扩展的成员语言类型。固定点复杂度条目补给具体见证；Craig 与创造集条目补给可检查的构造步骤。[[92-df-universal-closure]]、[[92-df-first-order-language]]、[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]、[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]记录新增接口。"},{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models_{\\in}$ (satisfaction for membership structures, 见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]的成员语言语义)"},{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"28c39f1dc8b3e62b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}$ (structure class, see [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]])"},{"id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_\\in=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\})$，语法与语义见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]。"},{"id":"fcf794bdb0764404","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语言、有限树公式、语义和约化见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]。数项在新语言中的使用均指解析翻译 $\\iota_G(\\bar n)$；算术结构约化后以相同解释数据读回本地 G 结构。紧致性使用[[92-thm-compactness]]的任意语言版本。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"1a9a64dce00ebd76","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\models_L$ 见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]。"},{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7